---
const appUrl = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_APP_URL || "http://localhost:3000/dashboard";
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pb-20 pt-20 sm:pt-28">
  <p class="mb-5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-zinc-500">Newsletter workspace</p>
  <h1 class="max-w-3xl text-5xl font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-tight text-zinc-950 sm:text-6xl">
    Write emails that look finished.
  </h1>
  <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-zinc-600">
    Gulle is a block canvas for campaigns, subscribers, and templates. Start blank, keep one margin, and send work that already looks like a real product email.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
    <a
      href={appUrl}
      class="inline-flex h-11 items-center rounded-full bg-zinc-950 px-5 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-zinc-800"
    >
      Open the app
    </a>
    <a
      href="/product"
      class="inline-flex h-11 items-center rounded-full border border-zinc-200 bg-white px-5 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-900 transition-colors hover:border-zinc-300"
    >
      See how it works
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
